# op::request
# ===========
# Verification, audit, or takedown/attribution request workflow against a suspect
# track or AI dataset artifact.

request(suspect_audio, manifest, secret_key) -> audit_report:
  1. Extract 64-bit CDMA spread-spectrum watermark from suspect_audio.
  2. Compute bit-match ratio and detection z-score (sigma) against manifest.watermark_payload_64bit.
  3. Compare 256-bit perceptual spectral hash similarity against clean master & stems.
  4. Verify .ots OpenTimestamps proof to establish prior art predating the suspect artifact.
